<CapabilityStatement xmlns="http://hl7.org/fhir">
  <id value="CSReceptorSIGGES"/>
  <text>
    <status value="extensions"/><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p class="res-header-id"><b>Generated Narrative: DeclaracionDeCapacidad CSReceptorSIGGES</b></p><a name="CSReceptorSIGGES"> </a><a name="hcCSReceptorSIGGES"> </a><h2 id="title">Receptor SIGGES (capa de interoperabilidad en etapa 1, SIGGES en etapa 2)</h2><ul><li>Implementation Guide Version: 0.4.0 </li><li>FHIR Version: 4.0.1 </li><li>Supported Formats: <code>json</code></li><li>Published on: 2026-09-30 </li><li>Published by: Unidad de Interoperabilidad - MINSAL </li></ul><blockquote class="impl-note"><p><strong>Note to Implementers: FHIR Capabilities</strong></p><p>Any FHIR capability may be 'allowed' by the system unless explicitly marked as 'SHALL NOT'. A few items are marked as MAY in the Implementation Guide to highlight their potential relevance to the use case.</p></blockquote><h3 id="shallIGs">SHALL Support the Following Implementation Guides</h3><ul><li><a href="index.html">https://interoperabilidad.minsal.cl/fhir/ig/sigges/ImplementationGuide/hl7.fhir.cl.minsal.sigges</a></li></ul><h2 id="rest">FHIR RESTful Capabilities</h2><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h3 id="mode1" class="panel-title">Mode: <code>server</code></h3></div><div class="panel-body"><div><p>Toda interacción usa TLS 1.2 o superior. Los datos personales nunca viajan en la URL: la consulta por RUN se hace con POST [base]/EpisodeOfCare/_search.</p>
</div><div class="lead"><em>Security</em></div><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-6">Enable CORS: no</div><div class="col-lg-6">Security services supported: <code>OAuth</code></div></div><blockquote><div><p>OAuth 2.0 con grant_type=client_credentials. Cada client_id se asocia a uno o más códigos DEIS; el receptor rechaza un MessageHeader.sender que no corresponda al cliente autenticado.</p>
</div></blockquote><div class="row"><div class="col-12"><span class="lead">Summary of System-wide Operations</span><table class="table table-condensed table-hover"><thead><tr><th>Conformance</th><th>Operation</th><th>Documentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>$process-message</td><td><div><p>Recibe un BundleNotificacionGES y responde, de forma síncrona, un BundleRespuestaGES (ok, transient-error o fatal-error). Idempotencia por identifier[folio] del recurso foco; reintento de transporte con el mismo Bundle.identifier.</p>
</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><h3 id="resourcesCap1">Capabilities by Resource/Profile</h3><h4 id="resourcesSummary1">Summary</h4><p>The summary table lists the resources that are part of this configuration, and for each resource it lists:</p><ul><li>The relevant profiles (if any)</li><li>The interactions supported by each resource (<b><span class="bg-info">R</span></b>ead, <b><span class="bg-info">S</span></b>earch, <b><span class="bg-info">U</span></b>pdate, and <b><span class="bg-info">C</span></b>reate, are always shown, while <b><span class="bg-info">VR</span></b>ead, <b><span class="bg-info">P</span></b>atch, <b><span class="bg-info">D</span></b>elete, <b><span class="bg-info">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class="bg-info">I</span></b>nstance, or <b><span class="bg-info">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class="bg-info">T</span></b>ype are only present if at least one of the resources has support for them.</li><li><span>The required, recommended, and some optional search parameters (if any). </span></li><li>The linked resources enabled for <code>_include</code></li><li>The other resources enabled for <code>_revinclude</code></li><li>The operations on the resource (if any)</li></ul><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-condensed table-hover"><thead><tr><th><b>Resource Type</b></th><th><b>Perfil</b></th><th class="text-center"><b title="GET a resource (read interaction)">R</b></th><th class="text-center"><b title="GET all set of resources of the type (search interaction)">S</b></th><th class="text-center"><b title="PUT a new resource version (update interaction)">U</b></th><th class="text-center"><b title="POST a new resource (create interaction)">C</b></th><th><b title="Required and recommended search parameters">Searches</b></th><th><code><b>_include</b></code></th><th><code><b>_revinclude</b></code></th><th><b>Operations</b></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="#EpisodeOfCare1-1">EpisodeOfCare</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-caso-ges.html">Caso GES</a></td><td class="text-center"/><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center"/><td class="text-center"/><td>patient, status, type</td><td><code>EpisodeOfCare:condition</code></td><td><code>Task:focus</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href="#Task1-2">Task</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-garantia-oportunidad-ges.html">Garantía de oportunidad</a><br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-cierre-caso-ges.html">CC — Cierre de caso</a><br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-excepcion-garantia-ges.html">EXGO — Excepción de garantía de oportunidad</a></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center"/><td class="text-center"/><td class="text-center"/><td/><td/><td/><td/></tr></tbody></table></div><hr/><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 id="EpisodeOfCare1-1" class="panel-title"><span style="float: right;">Resource Conformance: unspecified </span>EpisodeOfCare</h4></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-4"><span class="lead">Core FHIR Resource</span><br/><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/episodeofcare.html">EpisodeOfCare</a></div><div class="col-lg-4"><span class="lead">Reference Policy</span><br/></div><div class="col-lg-4"><span class="lead">Interaction summary</span><br/><ul><li>Supports <br/><code>search-type</code><div><p>Por POST [base]/EpisodeOfCare/_search. patient.identifier (encadenado) con system|valor del RUN.</p>
</div></li></ul></div></div><p/><div class="row"><div class="col-6"><span class="lead">Supported Profiles</span><p><a href="StructureDefinition-caso-ges.html">Caso GES</a></p></div></div><p/><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-7"><span class="lead">Search Parameters</span><table class="table table-condensed table-hover"><thead><tr><th>Conformance</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Documentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/episodeofcare.html#search">patient</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Se usa encadenado: patient.identifier={system del RUN}|{RUN}. Obligatorio.</p>
</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/episodeofcare.html#search">status</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/episodeofcare.html#search">type</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>Problema de salud GES (CSProblemaSaludGES).</p>
</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="col-lg-5"> </div></div></div></div></div><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 id="Task1-2" class="panel-title"><span style="float: right;">Resource Conformance: unspecified </span>Task</h4></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-4"><span class="lead">Core FHIR Resource</span><br/><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/task.html">Task</a></div><div class="col-lg-4"><span class="lead">Reference Policy</span><br/></div><div class="col-lg-4"><span class="lead">Interaction summary</span><br/><ul><li>Supports <code>read</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/><div class="row"><div class="col-6"><span class="lead">Supported Profiles</span><p><a href="StructureDefinition-garantia-oportunidad-ges.html">Garantía de oportunidad</a><br/><a href="StructureDefinition-cierre-caso-ges.html">CC — Cierre de caso</a><br/><a href="StructureDefinition-excepcion-garantia-ges.html">EXGO — Excepción de garantía de oportunidad</a></p></div></div><p/><div class="row"><div class="col-12"><span class="lead">Documentation</span><blockquote><div><p>Las garantías las publica SIGGES; el establecimiento las obtiene con _revinclude=Task:focus en la búsqueda de casos.</p>
</div></blockquote></div></div></div></div></div><h2 id="messaging">FHIR Messaging Capabilities</h2><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h3 id="messaging_1" class="panel-title">Messaging Capability</h3></div><div class="panel-body"/></div></div>
